WEBVTT

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.440
All of the various economic

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.770
powers are hastily preparing 
to launch their forces.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.750
So I see...

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.300
These AHSMB units will 
be our primary fighters!

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.210
Make sure they're in tip-top shape!

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.870
Yes, Boss!

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:24.870
Got it!

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.590
Our fleets against 
theirs? Sounds exciting!

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.590
Accurate instructions are a must to

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:33.270
keep our allies from 
falling into disarray.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.490
You're always so uptight!

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.570
You'll never get anywhere like that...

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.190
with the enemy or women.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.430
If you have time for idle chatter,

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.860
work on memorizing the 
enemy's formations!

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.270
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.450
I have no idea what to 
expect from the Wulgaru.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.290
After all, they consider this "hunting".

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.330
We need be prepared for an attack

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.420
if they strike while we're on the move.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.900
Come what may, our 
primary goal is to reach

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.240
the gate in one piece.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.240
Right.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:03.580
But how will we power the 
gate-destroying Straggle Laser?

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.940
Weren't the flagships 
from the economic powers

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.370
supposed to supply the power?

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.780
That's the plan,

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:11.920
but the charge time upon reaching 
the gate takes too long.

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:15.590
If the enemy opened fire, they'd 
have no choice but to sit it out.

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:20.930
You're making Izuru participate 
in this operation?

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.820
As his primary physician, 
I can't permit this.

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:27.480
I understand,

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:30.230
but the fate of Earth rests on 
the success of this operation.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:34.420
I am aware of the position 
you're in, but I am a doctor!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:36.400
It is my job to protect my patients.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.210
You still haven't been discharged 
from the hospital, have you?

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:16.370
"Night before the Decisive Battle"

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.890
I have to participate in this operation!

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.330
Stay and get your rest!

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:21.550
Wow! Just now, didn't you 
sound kinda big brother-ish?

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:24.900
Izuru!

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.940
No, no! You're supposed to take it easy.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.380
You should stop him, Asagi!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:29.100
I'm trying to!

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.520
Yep! Big Brother hasn't 
done anything wrong.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:34.150
I've already told you, 
stop calling me that!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.900
Huh? What's the big deal?

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:39.620
We merely inherited DNA 
from the same human.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.900
And it feels weird for him to 
suddenly start calling me that...

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:45.490
But it doesn't change the fact that 
you're Izuru's brother, does it?

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.640
I should have kept this to myself...

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:50.970
I'm kinda jealous! You've got a brother!

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:54.080
In that case, Suruga, you're 
free to call me "Big Bro".

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.000
No freaking way!

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:59.920
But isn't everyone here 
sorta like family?

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.630
That's how I think of you guys.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:04.260
Tamaki...

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:06.720
Asagi is my big brother,

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:08.650
Izuru is my little brother,

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.560
and I guess Kei is like my mom!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.030
Who are you calling a mom?!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.590
What 'bout me? Well? Well?

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:16.950
Commander Simon!

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:22.150
Izuru Hitachi, I need 
to have a word with you.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.210
Well, we'd better be going.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:32.160
Izuru Hitachi, submit your 
resignation papers immediately.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:33.870
Is that clear?

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.650
A moment, sir!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.000
That was an order!

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:39.640
I am going to fight!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:40.980
Not happening.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.800
Why not?!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:46.010
In your current condition, you 
could jeopardize the operation.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:47.720
I'll do my best to see that I don't!

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.670
Waiting for everyone alone 
at a safe distance...

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.630
That would be far harder on me!

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.280
I've fought along their 
sides this whole time!

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.820
Please, sir!

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:06.820
Even if... piloting an AHSMB 
again could prove fatal?

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:15.140
We were born for the 
sole purpose to fight.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.800
That's what we were raised to do;

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.060
why our memories were erased.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:20.750
But... But despite all 
of that, I made friends

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.300
and had some fun times.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.280
So I want to be with everyone!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.430
If they are out there fighting, 
then I want to fight, too!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.770
I will grant you permission 
to board the Godinion.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:45.330
Thank you, sir!

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:01.090
I will fight with all of my might,

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:04.090
so that Izuru doesn't have 
to enter the frontlines.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:07.920
I will protect him!

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:12.050
Izuru is my friend... as 
well as my little brother!

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:18.410
Uh, I'm still the only one who 
knows about our DNA donors.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:20.530
I see.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.490
COMPOSURE

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.790
Welcome back!

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.780
Everything okay?

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:32.710
Yeah.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:33.760
What about Izuru?

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.450
He'll be able to board the Godinion.

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:36.830
Is he all right?

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.130
Ange, have you finished 
your medical exams?

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:44.200
They said I should be able to fight.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:44.980
I see.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.090
But how about Izuru...?

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.840
Let's do our best to 
make sure he doesn't

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:50.970
have to enter the fray!

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:51.930
Yeah!

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:53.550
I'll do my very bestest!

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:54.440
Right!

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.620
I feel as though they have

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:05.620
taught me that new lives grow 
and develop on their own.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:10.240
In that case, it is our job to do 
all we can to protect those lives.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.940
I will personally participate 
in this operation.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.200
But-

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.280
I have made my mind.

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:23.080
We won't be using Red 5.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:23.910
What?!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.980
We can't reliably count 
on him in battle.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:29.840
So please devise a plan 
that doesn't require him.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:31.890
Very well.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:36.260
Losing Red 5 hurts, but I'll 
come up with something.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:39.060
In exchange, Imperial Princess 
Teoria will be accompanying us.

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.420
Have you reached a decision?

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:53.360
I have.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:56.050
I see. Thank you.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:57.880
As of right now, you are

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.910
the Supreme Commander presiding 
over this operation.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:03.050
In exchange, I have a 
favor to ask of you.

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:06.230
There is something I'd like to use.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:10.010
With our next strike, we will 
bring this shikaara to an end.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.810
We shall overtake Earth in one bout and

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:17.810
seize the genes that 
Klein failed to obtain!

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:19.730
The final shikaara...

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:21.490
I can hardly wait.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:26.230
Fight with all of your might...

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:29.650
...for our great ancestors 
and descendants!

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:39.660
I am bewildered by these lamata 
whom we refer to as "Earthlings".

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:40.800
Sir?

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.320
There are times when they prioritize

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:45.680
the life of another over their own.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:49.000
That is not the correct action 
for any living creature to take.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.900
Thinking back on the prior 
species we've hunted,

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.770
the individual beings always 
prioritized their own lives.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:57.890
However...

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:03.060
No, we must hunt them down.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.860
We have continued the shikaara in 
pursuit of increasingly advanced genes,

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:13.030
believing that such measures will 
help us survive in this universe...

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.270
Is that not so, Lumes?

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:19.780
Yes, sir. That was what 
the oracle proclaimed.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:26.870
Prince Jiart, the final 
shikaara is about to begin.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.060
Was this my brother's decision?

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:29.880
It was.

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:32.350
Have you heard word from Teoria?

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:33.690
Nothing as of yet.

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:35.300
Either she has already passed away...

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:39.210
...or she has no desire to return to us.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:44.260
Once this is over, we should be 
able to find Princess Teoria.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:45.720
True enough.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:48.060
Cheers to the shikaara!

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:57.730
I repeat: All civilians 
residing on Star Rose,

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:00.440
please evacuate to Earth 
with all due haste.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:03.420
I repeat: All civilians 
residing on Star Rose,

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:06.440
Why does everyone suddenly 
have to leave Star Rose?

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.550
Probably 'cause it's dangerous up here.

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:10.760
Does that mean the enemy could 
make it this close to Earth?

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:11.710
That's a possibility.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.340
Oh, guys! So this is where you went!

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:19.390
They're about to hold a general 
briefing for the upcoming operation!

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:23.810
Once that's over, you're 
supposed to board the Godinion.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.320
Great Chinese Alliance

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:40.240
Organization of the 
Bela-Russian Conference

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:44.160
United Provinces of Africa

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:48.080
GDF General Headquarters

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:56.420
Now then, I am going to brief 
you on Operation: Heaven's Gate.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.680
The primary goal of this operation 
is to destroy the enemy's gate.

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:05.580
At a pre-determined time, all fleets 
will begin heading toward the gate.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.670
We will instruct you on how to handle

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.290
any battles along the way as we see fit.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.620
Upon reaching the gate, you are 
to swiftly enter formation

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.360
and prepare for the enemy to strike.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.780
I will explain the fleets' strategies 
at a different point in time.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:21.600
The MJP's Team Rabbits will 
fight in the frontlines.

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:23.450
All armies are to offer 
their full support.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.190
All AHSMBs will be equipped 
with the markers needed

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:30.380
for when we fire the 
Straggle Laser at the gate.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.720
Blue 1, Rose 3 and Black 6 will upset

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:36.360
the enemy formation while 
moving toward the gate.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.560
Gold 4 will offer support.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.520
Purple 2 will issue 
orders from the rear.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:44.010
The AHSMB units will take whatever 
formation is necessary to

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.110
launch the markers, while all fleets 
will offer their full support.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.080
As soon as they've launched the 
markers, we will fire the Straggle Laser.

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:51.980
That is all.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:02.460
Did you understand the 
outline of the operation?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.130
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.490
We plow in and ka-boom!

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:06.920
Exactly.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:07.770
Excuse me!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.470
What about me?

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.940
You'll remain on standby 
with us on the bridge.

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:12.800
Standby?!

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:13.830
We aren't dispatching you.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.250
I feel fine!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.200
Red 5!

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.890
Really, I wish I could leave 
you and your unit behind.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:23.270
But there isn't room for 
mistakes in this operation.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:27.180
As such, there is a possibility that 
I may end up ordering you to sortie.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.850
However, that is a last resort.

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:31.930
Understood?

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.620
I can't believe I'm stuck on standby...

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.080
I'm relieved.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:45.830
Now I don't have to worry about 
your health while I'm fighting.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.590
You didn't have to put it like that!

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.220
That was cruel, Asagi.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:50.930
Huh?

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.800
But Asagi's absolutely right!

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:56.710
We'll do our best out there, 
Izuru, so cheer us on!

00:12:58.180 --> 00:12:59.800
Please leave this to us.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.350
Not you too, Ange!

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:02.720
I'm sorry...

00:13:05.940 --> 00:13:06.860
In that case...

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.110
Everyone, fight!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:11.140
You literally cheered for us, sheesh...

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.470
Huh? Isn't that your pit crew, Asagi?

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:15.390
Huh?

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:17.030
Asagi!

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:17.860
What's the matter?

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.000
Anna has gone missing!

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.250
She's gone missing?

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.790
We can't bring her with us 
on this upcoming operation.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:26.170
And since all civilians have been 
ordered to evacuate Star Rose,

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:27.870
we tried to send her down to Earth.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:30.340
After she threw a tantrum 
saying she wouldn't go,

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:31.800
she ran off somewhere.

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:34.990
Anna!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:37.120
Anna dear!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:39.370
Anna!

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:41.050
Anna!

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.740
The Shopping Arcade that Floats 
in Space: Star Rose Galaxy

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:46.970
She isn't here, is she?

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.900
This place is a total ghost town, huh?

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.890
It seems rather forlorn, doesn't it?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.590
We can't find her after all of this.

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:57.670
I bet she must have 
taken the last pod down.

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:02.630
I'll check the list of passengers, so 
please make your way to the Godinion!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.460
Asagi, do you have any idea 
where she might have gone?

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:14.960
Star Rose Galaxy Rest Area

00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:17.050
Hey!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.670
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.720
I wanted one last ice cream cone.

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:29.820
Come on. We're going.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:30.520
No!

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:31.300
Anna!

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:34.830
I wanna stay with Papa and Grandpa!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:37.230
Even if I went down to 
Earth, I'd be all alone.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.130
You still can't come.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:42.790
We can't take you with us.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:47.340
Your dad and grandpa don't 
want to put you in harm's way.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:51.630
I know how they feel.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.140
This is what it means to be family.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.710
I don't want to see 
him get hurt, either.

00:14:58.510 --> 00:14:59.370
My family, I mean.

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:02.830
I wonder why...

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.070
It's so strange!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:08.940
We merely share the same DNA, 
so why do I feel this way...?

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:11.350
Asagi, you have a family of your own?

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:13.530
Yeah, I do.

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:17.170
When I heard that he wouldn't 
be participating in operation,

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:20.230
I felt relieved... big time.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.230
So let's go.

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.350
Uh-huh.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.420
Big Brother, fight!

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.370
Fight!

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:44.310
Lady Teoria, I will protect you.

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:46.630
Please protect Izuru and 
the others instead of me.

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:52.570
Why do we allow genetics to have 
such a strong hold over us?

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:56.110
It feels as though we 
are slaves to our genes.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.560
Lady Teoria...

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:02.040
But I cannot help but wonder, 
"Why was I drawn to Earth?"

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.940
I believe that while humans 
are slaves to their genes,

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.520
they are also capable of 
surpassing their genetics.

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:11.460
Genetics are what connects families,

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.690
clans and nations and 
allows them to survive,

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:17.330
but occasionally people are able

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.130
to protect others due to 
"love" and "friendship".

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:23.810
That is true.

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:28.670
Sometimes the humans defy their 
genetics and follow their hearts.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:33.130
It was worth abandoning the 
Wulgaru simply to learn that.

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:35.870
I appreciate everything 
you've done, Daneel.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:40.570
Ninety-five percent of Star 
Rose has been evacuated.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.280
Is that right? Thank you.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:46.450
Why did we need to clear out Star Rose?

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:48.370
The Supreme Commander issued that order.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:49.590
The Supreme Commander?

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.690
Not the GDF's Commander-in-Chief?

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:55.000
Right. He is finally making his move.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:01.180
They said that this is the 
last pod going down to Earth.

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:02.660
I'm glad we made it in time!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:05.390
Yeah. Anna's dad and 
grandpa were able to

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:07.390
put their minds at ease 
and return to the Pit.

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:10.230
Now we can finally head 
on out to the Godinion!

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:12.340
Yep! Please hurry on over!

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.220
Asagi!

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:17.590
Hey, kid!

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.320
What were you thinking?!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:20.650
I'm going with you after all!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:21.990
What are you talking about?

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.890
How am I supposed to 
explain this to your dad?

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.130
I'm going anyway!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:26.850
Hey!

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:31.160
I don't... want to wait...

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:34.000
alone on Earth worrying about everyone!

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:40.620
You win.

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:44.220
But let's beat those Wulgaru!

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.210
Yeah!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:59.290
I'm sorry...

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:04.240
C'mon! We're down to the last lap!

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.890
Let's give it all we've got!

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:09.200
Miss, we have her running 
perfectly for you.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.330
Thank you.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:13.250
Um... I made this for you!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:14.870
Let's eat it together...

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:15.960
What is that?

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:17.420
It's a cake...

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:18.450
Is it edible?

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.210
It might be a bit sweet.

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.170
All right. We'll give it a try.

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:25.730
Too sweet!

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:27.390
This is awful!

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:30.460
I'll teach you how to bake a 
cake once this mission is over.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.390
I'll kick their butts, 
so lend me a hand!

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:37.950
You're welcome to call us "Bro"!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.030
Huh?!

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:41.850
We heard that you're 
lookin' for a big brother.

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.900
Nah, I'm cool...

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:44.990
Let's hear it!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.140
Say it nice and loud!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.520
No, I'll pass! I don't 
need any brothers!

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:56.990
I need to watch what I say 
when I'm piloting you...

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.360
Otherwise all of Earth 
will hear my potty mouth.

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.460
You locked it?

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:03.560
Sorry 'bout that!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.980
I heard those were Captain 
Suzukaze's orders.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:08.600
That way you won't take off 
without permission, Izuru.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.750
But maintenance-wise, it's good to go.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:15.530
Everyone, all of the fleets 
will be launching soon!

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:19.400
Izuru, please go to the bridge.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.010
Huh?

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.680
You are on standby.

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:24.290
Izuru...

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:29.320
You weren't born for the 
sole purpose to fight.

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:32.450
The way Rin-Rin locked Red 5 shows 
that she feels the same way I do.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.300
The designated time for 
launch will be in 12 hours.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.550
Kei?

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:47.720
Is something the matter?

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:51.540
If it's about Izuru, he'll be fine.

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:55.630
I'll make sure he doesn't get sent out.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.060
Asagi...

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:58.940
I'll do my best to make sure 
he doesn't have to fight.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:00.720
You can count us in on that, too!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.820
All of us will do our best out there!

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:04.720
I will do the very best I possibly can.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:05.940
Ange...

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.560
I'm counting on you, Ange.

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:08.470
Right!

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:11.240
Guys, we've got to strive 
to become heroes!

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:13.580
And amazing enough to make 
Izuru green with envy!

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:14.570
Asagi,

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:16.820
don't push yourself too hard.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.230
Right.

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:20.370
Make sure to take some antacids.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:23.850
Actually, I don't need antacids anymore!

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:26.050
You still have the residual 
airs of a failure...

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.150
True enough!

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:28.240
Seriously!

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:31.020
Shut up!

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.610
Informing all fleets:

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.570
I am hereby transferring 
all authority of command

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.820
over the current operation 
to the following individual,

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:52.020
Simon Gato of the MJP.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:55.940
I am Simon Gato.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.880
I will be issuing all 
commands from the Star Rose.

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.320
The Star Rose?!

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:05.280
Operation: Heaven's Gate, activate!

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:07.210
Cables, purge!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:12.430
The Star Rose will carry 
all of the fleets' ships!

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:26.440
Captain Amane, it's from 
Supreme Commander Simon.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:30.640
Upon retrieval of the fleets' 
vessels, I will take off.

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:34.490
Sir, how are you navigating 
the Star Rose?

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:36.600
The Star Rose's core is a

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:39.980
refined version of the Wulgaru 
ship that Teoria used to fly here.

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:44.150
We will use the Star Rose as the 
energy source for the Straggle Laser.

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:01.210
Have the troops advance!

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:04.130
Star Rose, blast off!

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:56.040
"Operation: Heaven's Gate"
